  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Best for Dry, Combo, Normal Skin</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A luminous foundation with light coverage and hydrating ingredients like hyaluronic acid for a natural, lit-from-within glow.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Light</p><p><strong><br>Finish: </strong>Radiant</p><p><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Liquid</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Best for Skin Types</strong>: Normal, Dry, and Combination</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Three Forms of Hyaluronic Acid: Visibly plump and hydrate.</p><p>- Plant-Derived Squalane: Visibly improves elasticity and diffuses fine lines.</p><p>- Kombucha: Enhances the look of smoothness and radiance.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong></p><p>Patrick's Artistry Technique:</p><p>-Shake well.</p><p>-Add one to two pumps to the back of your hand and spread it out.</p><p>-Distribute the formula evenly into the bristles of a dense foundation brush or a blending sponge and apply a light layer to skin.</p><p>-Start at the center of the face and move outwards along the hairline and jawline.</p><p>-Pro Tip: Always apply a loose setting powder for a longer-lasting finish.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Three Forms of Hyaluronic Acid: Visibly plump and hydrate. <br>-Plant-Derived Squalane: Visibly improves elasticity and diffuses fine lines. <br>-Kombucha: Enhances the look of smoothness and radiance. <br><br>Shades 1-20: Water (Aqua, Eau), Glycerin, Isononyl Isononanoate, Propanediol, Dicaprylyl Ether, Squalane, Pentaerythrityl Tetraisostearate, Hydrogenated Styrene/Methylstyrene/Indene Copolymer, Hydrogenated Ethylhexyl Olivate, Polyglyceryl-6 Polyricinoleate, Polyglyceryl-2 Dipolyhydroxystearate, Isostearyl Neopentanoate, C9-12 Alkane, Dimer Dilinoleyl Dimer Dilinoleate, Polyglyceryl-2 Isostearate, PVP, Lauroyl Lysine, Dipalmitoyl Hydroxyproline, Myristyl Myristate, Magnesium Sulfate, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Lecithin, Phenoxyethanol, Propylene Carbonate, Zinc Stearate, Octyldodecyl Stearoyl Stearate, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Sodium Benzoate, Saccharomyces/Xylinum/Black Tea Ferment, Distarch Phosphate, Allantoin, Hydrogenated Olive Oil Unsaponifiables, Coco-Caprylate/Caprate, Tocopherol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Sodium Dehydroacetate, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-di-t-butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Potassium Sorbate, May Contain (+/-): Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499). <br><br>Shades 21-30: Water (Aqua, Eau), Glycerin, Isododecane, Squalane, Propanediol, Pentaerythrityl Tetraisostearate, Isononyl Isononanoate, Dicaprylyl Ether, Hydrogenated Styrene/Methylstyrene/Indene Copolymer, Dimer Dilinoleyl Dimer Dilinoleate, Caprylyl Caprylate/Caprate, Polyglyceryl-6 Polyricinoleate, Polyglyceryl-2 Dipolyhydroxystearate, Isostearyl Neopentanoate, Polyglyceryl-2 Isostearate, C9-12 Alkane, PVP, Lauroyl Lysine, Dipalmitoyl Hydroxyproline, Myristyl Myristate, Magnesium Sulfate, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Lecithin, Hydrogenated Ethylhexyl Olivate, Phenoxyethanol, Propylene Carbonate, Zinc Stearate, Octyldodecyl Stearoyl Stearate, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Sodium Benzoate, Saccharomyces/Xylinum/Black Tea Ferment, Distarch Phosphate, Allantoin, Hydrogenated Olive Oil Unsaponifiables, Coco-Caprylate/Caprate, Tocopherol, Sodium Hyaluronate, Sodium Dehydroacetate, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Pentaerythrityl tetra-di-t-butyl hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Potassium Sorbate, May Contain (+/-): Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499).</div></details>",
